#AREA In the Air~

#AUTHORS Copper ~

#HELPS
-1 AIR 'IN THE AIR'~
IN THE AIR
This area refers to the magical air above the central city of Chakkor,
arguably the largest and most common city in the Realms. Certain creatures
are known to frequent the skies there, including Griffons and Fairy
Dragons and other winged creatures indigenous to Chakkor and the
surrounding landscape. It is said that all rainbows begin in Chakkor.
Perhaps there is some truth in this hearsay.

     This area was originally created by Copper.

     Revised by Emperor on June 4th, 1998.

~
0 $~

#RANGES 5 10 0 99

#MOBILES
#1000
fairy dragon~
The fairy dragon~
A fairy dragon is fluttering around here looking for something to do.~
It's a cute little multi-colored dragon...about 2 feet long. It gracefully
dances in the air around your head.~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_MAGIC|AFF_FLYING
500 S
5 0 0 5d5+50 2d4+1
20 631
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
#1001
baby griffon~
The baby griffon~
A baby griffon fumbles around here.~
The baby only has a partial mane, which is white with little streaks of
yellow.~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_FLYING
300 S
8 0 0 1d1+104 2d5+2
500 1286
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
#1002
griffon~
The griffon~
A large black winged griffon swoops into an attack.~
Golden maned and black all over.  It's quite a beautiful creature if not
for the fact it is hungry and is attacking you!~
ACT_AGGRESSIVE|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_FLYING
300 S
8 0 0 1d1+104 2d5+2
500 1286
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
#1003
wind elemental~
The wind elemental~
A wind elemental spins in a funnel here.~
The elemental is an astral creature created out of a gust of magical
astral drifts on the elemental plane. It has two red eyes that peer out
from the top of it's wild funnel.~ 
ACT_STAY_AREA AFF_FLYING
300 S
8 0 0 1d1+104 2d5+2
500 1286
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>rand_prog 15~
mpecho The wind elemental spins into a maelstrom.
~
|
#1004
old leprechaun~
The old leprechaun~
An old leprechaun sits here, wizened with venerable age.~
The leprechaun is very old. He has a long grey beard, and sage verdant
eyes. He is very small yet somehow he intimidates you. He wears the
traditional garb of a leprechaun, except it is apparent he has not
been active for some time.~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_TONGUES
300 S
20 0 0 1d1+900 2d3+20
500 1286
POS_RESTING POS_RESTING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest (0, 2, $n) == 0
 look $n
 stand
 look $n
 smile
 say Welcome traveler!
 say Do you come for an attempt on the stone?
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
say Excellent!
say For a thousand years, I have been the guardian of
say the last house of the world... this small stone house.
say It is a magical place indeed!
say All rainbows begin from a sacred room within these walls
say Within that room is the source of power for all rainbows
say That source is called: the Blarney Stone
say It is a sacred stone of secret power,
say and it can be yours, if you can answer my riddle
grin
say If you think you can do it, say 'I can do it'
~
>speech_prog p I can do it~
if quest (0, 2, $n) == 0
 mpmset $n quest 0 2 1
 say Excellent!
 say But I'll only give you the riddle if you are smart. 
 grin
else
endif
~
>rand_prog 15~
tap
~
>speech_prog p I am smart~
if quest (0, 2, $n) == 1
 mpmset $n quest 0 2 2
 smile $n
 say Good!
 say Very well $n... here is my riddle:
 say Together, we can never be
 say When he is there, you won't see me
 say When I am there, you cannot see
 say What am I and Who is he?
endif
~
>speech_prog p moon and sun~
if quest (0, 2, $n) == 2
 mpmset $n quest 0 2 3
 mpecho The old leprechaun's eyes open wide!
 mpecho The old leprechaun nearly falls over.
 say You've done it! You've solved the riddle!
 say You may now have access to the secret room
 say The place where the Blarney Stone is kept
 say and which you may now receive!
 say To gain entrance to the chamber 
 say simply say the word 'kcul'
endif
~
>speech_prog kcul~
look $n
stand
if quest (0, 2, $n) == 3
 connect 4 1047
 nod $n
 mpecho The old leprechaun utters the words, 'riaehtni'.
 mpforce $n up
 connect 4 -1
endif
~
|
